    "text": "16 hours ago Tucked away in the small town of Opp, Alabama, Frank Jackson State Park is one of those rare gems that most people drive right past without ever knowing it exists. Spread across 2,050 scenic acres, this park wraps around a beautiful lake and offers something for just about everyone, from families with young kids to seasoned campers looking for a quiet escape. Read full article",
